<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Web">
	<PropertyGroup>
		<Description>Norse web-server abstractions: IDeferredSignIn (the hosting-concern contract Midgard's Infrastructure.Web.Server implements against, so Himinbjorg's identity layer never depends on Midgard directly) and the mediator law surface (ICommandRequest&lt;TResponse&gt;, IRequestHandler, IBehavior, BehaviorAttribute) — the server-side law for the web tier. IWebHostPlugin and IDocumentRepository&lt;T&gt; are scaffolded, not yet implemented. Mutually invisible with Norse.Abstractions.Worker.</Description>
	</PropertyGroup>
	<ItemGroup>
		<ProjectReference Include="../Abstractions.Backend/Abstractions.Backend.csproj" />
		<ProjectReference Include="../Abstractions.Contracts/Abstractions.Contracts.csproj" />
	</ItemGroup>
</Project>
